  "description_short": "Family-run bistro serving honest comfort food and warm hospitality in the heart of Sedgefield.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in Sedgefield, Little Prince is a family-run bistro that's become a local favourite for its unpretentious approach to good food. The relaxed atmosphere makes it equally suitable for a casual lunch or an evening out with friends, with a menu that focuses on well-executed comfort classics rather than culinary theatrics.\n\nThe kitchen turns out honest, satisfying dishes that change with the seasons and what's available locally. Regulars praise the generous portions and consistent quality, whether you're ordering a hearty breakfast, a midweek lunch, or dinner. The service is warm and genuine, with the kind of personal touch you only get at truly independent establishments.\n\nSedgefield's laid-back village charm extends to Little Prince, where you'll find both locals and visitors enjoying the relaxed pace. It's the kind of place that feels welcoming from the moment you walk in, perfect for refuelling after exploring the lagoon or simply escaping the busier tourist spots along the Garden Route.",
